WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.840
Dear Jesus, may I enter into the eternal divine order of God to place my absolute nothingness

2
00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:13.840
in the heart of the most holy trinity, to give to my God the joy of fulfilling the purpose

3
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:19.320
of my existence by doing all the acts of my life through the immaculate heart of my mother

4
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:23.160
Mary and in the divine will of God.

5
00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:30.440
And in this same manner may I live, pray, act, eat, walk, sleep, and do everything.

6
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:36.520
May my soul be devoid of any other longings, wants or desires, and may you, my beloved

7
00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:41.560
divine, will do with me whatever you want or desire.

8
00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:47.640
All I ask is that you bind me to your most holy will so intimately, that I may never

9
00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:54.280
swear from carrying out what I know to be your good pleasure, and that I remain so docile

10
00:00:54.280 --> 00:01:00.560
to the movements of your divine will that you never perceive even a breath of resistance

11
00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:04.520
in my soul to your requests of me.

12
00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:10.420
Come divine will with all the angels and saints, especially my sweet mother Mary, to touch my

13
00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:17.320
forehead, to imprint on it the Holy Spirit and infuse in me true light.

14
00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:23.400
So that I may understand the truth and the good that are in these writings and prayers

15
00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.240
in there.

